<title>UK: TABLE-Friendly Hotels returns to yr profit.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Friendly Hotels returns to yr profit.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 24, 1996</p>
<p>(million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence, diluted)   10.2		   vs 23.4 loss</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 3.5		    vs 3.5</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 5.7		    vs 5.7</p>
<p> Pretax		     4.47		   vs 6.26 loss</p>
<p> Turnover		   45.16		  vs 42.0</p>
<p>Full company name - Friendly Hotels Plc.</p>
<p>NOTE - The company owns and operates 56 hotels, mainly under the Quality Hotels and Comfort Inns brands. It said the year had begun well with &quot;useful&quot; increases in occupancy and room rates.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
